{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "id": "top-denial-reasons",
  "title": "Costliest denial reasons",
  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "e41177b2-31a0-4016-b721-a66efaea10cc",
      "question": "Which three denial reasons account for the most billed dollars on claims whose denial notice is dated in 2026, and what share of all billed dollars on those denied claims do they make up?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-04T05:32:53.366861Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-04T05:33:00.502342Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "The top three denial reasons by billed dollars on claims with denial notices dated in 2026 are:\n\n| Denial reason | Billed dollars | Share of total |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Medical necessity | $314,335.13 | 26.31% |\n| Coding error | $203,786.44 | 17.06% |\n| Prior authorization missing | $196,581.28 | 16.46% |\n\nTogether, these three reasons account for **59.83%** of all billed dollars on denied claims in 2026. [1]\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Structured retrieval result — healthcare_clinical — evidence `hermes-receipt:932e69e4c2b09ee96e78369de246552048c4614aec58e257ab5850e2e3794e65`",
        "citations": [
          {
            "number": 1,
            "evidenceId": "hermes-receipt:932e69e4c2b09ee96e78369de246552048c4614aec58e257ab5850e2e3794e65",
            "label": "Structured retrieval result — healthcare_clinical",
            "capabilityId": "structured_retrieval",
            "invocationId": "hermes-tool:chatcmpl-tool-02c2ed023feb4b91b5e02dc3b6ebd107"
          }
        ]
      },
